"Later, Badud leads a Giantsrest army to retake Halsmet and conquer Gemore, then the continent."
"Later, Nathan frees Halsmet's slaves and drives the archmage Exea out of the city."
"Later, Gemore beats Giantsrest's army in a mountain pass; the war ends when the Academy falls."
"Later, the Heirs free Giantsrest from its overlords and help rebuild it."
"Later, Nathan frees the slaves of the Chokiz industrial district, breaking thousands of collars."
"Later, Badud reverses time outside Halsmet."
"Years later, Giantsrest sends Gemore enchanted items and dimensional bags for manufactured goods."
"Years later, Halsmet trades its ore for Gemore's food and wants all Gemore's cordite for mining."
